    "body": "@yanliang567 You're right — I was referencing the v1 RESTful API docs which state the 100-entity limit. After  checking the v2.6.x docs for /v2/vectordb/entities/insert, I can confirm it does NOT mention any entity count limit. The v2 API intentionally removed this restriction. Apologies for the noise — please feel  free to close this issue.\n\n I'm developing a bug-mining project that automates the entire process from crawling official reference documentation to test generation and verification. [https://github.com/TestVDB](url)  It’s currently in the testing phase. This false positive has exposed issues in the documentation crawling and final verification stages. I’ll work on resolving them and will personally review and confirm everything before submitting next time.",
